---
name: Notes.QA
---

## Extensions

| Term | URI |
| --- | --- |
| `qa` | `org.dxos.deus.qa@1.0` |

## Blocks

```mdl
qa QA-1: a stored note is listed and readable
  handler: Notes.serve
  steps:
  - do: Store a note called hello with the text "hi there"
    send: PUT /notes/hello hi there
    expect: The service says the note is stored
    assert: status == 201
  - do: Open the index page
    send: GET /
    expect: hello is listed as a link
    assert: Text.contains "href=\"/notes/hello\"" content
  - do: Follow the hello link
    send: GET /notes/hello
    expect: The note's text is shown
    assert: content == "hi there"
```

```mdl
qa QA-2: a deleted note is gone
  handler: Notes.serve
  steps:
  - do: Store a note called draft
    send: PUT /notes/draft scratch
    expect: The note is stored
  - do: Delete the draft note
    send: DELETE /notes/draft
    expect: The service says it is deleted
  - do: Open the draft note again
    send: GET /notes/draft
    expect: The note is not found
    assert: status == 404
  - do: Check that the index page no longer lists draft
    expect: The list is empty
```
